919
01:16:19,010 --> 01:16:20,600
<font face="Segoe UI" size="78"><b>Đủ rồi đấy.</b></font>

920
01:16:20,600 --> 01:16:22,470
<font face="Segoe UI" size="78"><b>Bỏ mặc nó đi, Kusanagi.</b></font>

